  "body": "NOW BY NEGOTIATION - MOTIVATED OWNERS READY TO ENGAGE WITH THE MARKET!\r\n\r\nExceptional. Exclusive. Unforgettable.\r\n\r\nAn outstanding opportunity to secure an extraordinary coastal residence. Now offered By Negotiation, the owners are ready to engage with the market and welcome genuine interest and offers. This is your opportunity to make your move!\r\n\r\nCompleted in 2021, this remarkable residence delivers 393m² of sophisticated luxury across three beautifully designed levels, showcasing breathtaking Rangitoto and Hauraki Gulf views and an exceptional resort-style lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFive bedrooms, four bathrooms, an exclusive penthouse retreat, self-contained apartment, expansive north-facing entertaining, spa, cutting-edge smart-home technology, solar power with Tesla Powerwall, and exceptional parking for up to seven vehicles.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned on a fully fenced 668m² site, just moments from Kohimarama Beach, vibrant cafés and excellent schools, this outstanding home offers the ultimate combination of luxury, privacy, security and coastal convenience.\r\n\r\nThe breathtaking views, impressive scale and exceptional quality must be experienced in person. This is a home that truly delivers the wow factor!\r\n\r\nSophisticated, intelligent and effortlessly luxurious, this is a rare opportunity to secure an exceptional residence in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal locations.\r\n\r\nStep into a new era of luxury living, where architectural sophistication, intelligent technology and coastal elegance come together.\r\n\r\nTHE OWNERS ARE READY TO TALK. NOW IS THE TIME TO ACT.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing and discover this extraordinary home for yourself.",
